# Dashboard design system

One small catalog in `apps/dashboard/src/components/ui/` (barrel: `components/ui/index.ts`).
Full guide with examples: `apps/dashboard/docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`.

**Rule of use:** if the catalog has it, use it. If a look is wrong, fix the
component, never the call site. A new primitive needs a real second use, a
catalog entry here and in `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`, and an export in `index.ts`.
Rare one-off styles fold into the nearest catalog component.

## Catalog

| Family | Component | Use for |
|---|---|---|
| Surfaces | `Card` (+ `CardHeader`, `CardTitle`, `CardContent`; `padding`, `asChild`) | Every card, section, standalone list |
| | `InsetPanel` | Region inside a Card (sublist, preview, group) |
| | `SettingsSection` | Settings form card with title, description, actions |
| | `SectionHeading` | Heading of a group inside a page or card |
| Controls | `Button` | Every action (`default`, `secondary`, `ghost`, `ai`, `destructive`) |
| | `TextLink` | Inline text action, router or external link |
| | `OptionCard` + `OptionCardGrid` | Large selectable choice (mode, tier, plan) |
| | `SegmentedControl` | 2-5 short in-place options |
| | `FilterChip` + `FilterChipRow` | Toggleable filters |
| | `SearchField` | Search input with clear |
| | `Input`, `Textarea`, `Select`, `Switch`, `Label` | Forms (never native `<select>`) |
| | `DropdownMenu`, `Dialog` | Menus, modals |
| Feedback | `Callout` | Inline status / warning / error banner |
| | `ConfirmDialog` / `useConfirm()` | Every confirmation (never `window.confirm`) |
| | `EmptyState` (`tone="card" \| "dashed" \| "plain"`) | Empty lists and pages |
| | `Spinner`, `LoadingBlock`, `Skeleton` | Loading |
| | `ApiErrorBanner` | API error with retry (a Callout preset) |
| Data | `Badge` + `lib/badge-tones.ts` | Every pill: status, role, type, count label |
| | `MetaLine` | "a · b · c" muted facts |
| | `EntityRow`, `EntityList`, `DescriptionRow` | Rows of people, agents, keys; label/value pairs |
| | `StatTile`, `StatGrid` | KPIs |
| | `Chart` | Bar, line, area, and sparkline (`showAxes={false}`). Canvas, Overview, Usage. Swimlanes (`AgentActivityTimeline`) stay custom |
| | `CapBar` | Usage against a cap |
| | `Table` family | Tabular data |
| Identity | `IconTile` | Square icon or logo tile |
| | `Avatar` (`kind="person" \| "agent" \| "team"`) | One person, contact, agent, or empty-team face |
| | `AvatarStack`, `TeamFacepile` | Overlapping pile of people and agents. A team is `TeamFacepile`. |
| | `ChoiceSelect`, `ChoiceOption`, `AgentSelect` | Named rows in selects and menus: always a mark, then the name |

## Tokens

- Fonts: `--font-sans` (Inter), `--font-serif` (Source Serif 4, headings and agent text only) and `--font-mono` (JetBrains Mono) in `index.css`. No other families.
- Size ladder: `text-2xs`, `xs`, `sm`, `base`, `lg`, `xl`, `2xl`. Never `text-[Npx]`.
- Radius ladder: `Card`, `Dialog` `xl` > `Callout` `lg` > input, button, menu item `md`. `rounded-full` for `Badge`, avatars, dots, switches and count bubbles.
- No glows, no opacity steps on `border-border` or `text-text-muted`. Button height comes from `size`, never `h-*` in `className`.
- Colors: surface ladder `bg`, `bg-surface`, `bg-elevated`, `bg-hover`, `bg-input`; status via `status-success|warning|error|info`; AI via `ai`/`ai-ink`; brand via `accent`. No raw palette colors (`emerald-500`, `amber-600`, `red-500`).
- Badge tones: `neutral`, `accent`, `ai`, `success`, `warning`, `error`, `info`. Map domain values with `statusTone`, `roleTone`, `memberTypeTone`, `ratioTone`.

## Guard

`npm run lint` in `apps/dashboard` runs `scripts/check-design-system.mjs`. It fails on
`window.confirm`, native `<select>`, `text-[Npx]`, hand-rolled card strings,
`bg-bg-elevated/40`, raw status colors, capsule chips, `h-*` on a `<Button>`,
`text-text-muted/NN` and removed legacy classes.
Exempt a line only with a `design-system-ignore` comment and a reason.

Ratchet rules (`raw-button`, `raw-input`, `hex-color`, `arbitrary-radius`, `border-opacity`) compare per-file
counts against `scripts/design-system-baseline.json`: a file may not gain hits. After removing
debt, run `node scripts/check-design-system.mjs --update-baseline` to lock in the lower count.

## Anti-patterns

- Duplicating a card string or `className="panel"` instead of `<Card>`
- Hand-coloring a pill instead of `<Badge variant>`
- Page-local segmented controls, option cards, cap bars or confirm prompts
- Light-only shadows or gradients on random pages
- Legacy: `bg-surface-raised`, `border-border-subtle`, `bg-surface-muted`, `.badge-*`, `font-display`, `.panel-inset`
